OL,3,GNEWSADrilling takes place for coastal
OL,4,Aflood project
OL,5,
OL,6,FInvestigation work for a coastal flood
OL,7,Fdefence scheme protecting against
OL,8,Frising sea levels is under way.
OL,10,FThe Government of Jersey said the work
OL,11,Fat Havre des Pas would help it better
OL,12,Funderstand ground conditions beneath
OL,13,Fthe beach and shoreline.
OL,15,FThe Havre des Pas Coastal Flood
OL,16,FAlleviation Scheme aims to deliver
OL,17,Flong-term protection in an exposed to
OL,18,Fwave overtopping and rising sea levels,
OL,19,Fthe government said.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
