OL,3,GNEWSADrilling takes place for coastal
OL,4,Aflood project
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork was expected to last until
OL,7,FWednesday and involved specialist
OL,8,Fdrilling and ground testing at a number
OL,9,Fof spots along the beach, officials
OL,10,Fsaid.
